# Auth & OAuth agent

## Scope

- Sessions, passwords, OAuth (Google/VK/Yandex), Telegram login, email verify/reset
- Auth templates + `auth.css`; public welcome gate that mirrors login

## Rules

- Keep social button order and copy consistent across `/login/`, welcome, TG guest.
- CSRF on all state-changing POSTs.
- Session cookie: respect SameSite for Mini App (`none` + Secure when needed).

## DoD

- Login methods still reachable; redirect-back preserved.
- No plaintext secrets in templates/logs.
- Specialist opt-in 2FA (TOTP) applies to password + OAuth + Telegram when enabled; setup in profile «Вход».
